00:44:09.680 --> 00:44:13.315
Now the perceptual lens is the lens
you have when you look something.

00:44:13.315 --> 00:44:20.150
So supposing you have
a scenario such as a cafe.

00:44:20.150 --> 00:44:25.320
And there are all these people who
