solving the problem.

00:46:12.304 --> 00:46:14.405
And you're understanding the problem,
you're saying,

00:46:14.405 --> 00:46:15.990
what are the scale dynamics?

00:46:15.990 --> 00:46:16.670
What is changing?

00:46:16.670 --> 00:46:19.460
What are the dynamics that
